@startuml ListSequenceDiagram
title Listing upcoming orders: list

actor Baker
participant "BakerCli" as Cli
participant "ListCommand" as Cmd
participant "OrderList" as List

Baker -> Cli : list
Cli -> Cmd : new ListCommand()
Cli -> Cmd : execute(orders)
activate Cmd
Cmd -> List : getAll()
List --> Cmd : copy of all records
note right of Cmd
  Works on the copy returned by
  getAll(), so filtering/sorting
  here can never reorder or delete
  the stored records.
end note
Cmd -> Cmd : remove ENQUIRY / COLLECTED /\nCANCELLED / REJECTED records
Cmd -> Cmd : sort by due date\n(earliest first, no-date last)
alt at least one upcoming order
  Cmd --> Cli : "Here are your upcoming orders:" + lines
else no upcoming orders
  Cmd --> Cli : "You have no upcoming orders."
end
deactivate Cmd
Cli --> Baker : print message
@enduml
